# Only the linux baselines are committed — CI is linux, and that is the platform
# the visual verdict is made on. A local run on another platform writes its own
# baseline (mockups.spec.ts:34 explains why they cannot be shared: font fallback
# alone moves the toolbar by 6 px), which is useful locally and noise in a diff.
e2e/*-snapshots/*-darwin.png
e2e/*-snapshots/*-win32.png

